{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13078","headline":"送郴县裴明府之任兼充宣慰 · 郎士元","name":"送郴县裴明府之任兼充宣慰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白苹楚水三湘远，芳草秦城二月初。\n连鴈北飞看欲尽，孤舟南去意何如。\n渡江野老思求瘼，候馆郴人忆下车。\n别後天涯何所寄，故交惟有袖中书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}